          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua gathered all the tribes of Israel together at Shechem. He called the elders, the leaders, the judges, and the officers of Israel, and they came into the presence of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 11.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua said to all the people, “This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, has to say: ‘Long ago your ancestors lived on the other side of the River Euphrates and worshipped other gods. One of those ancestors was Terah, the father of Abraham and Nahor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.1+GEN.12.2+GEN.12.3+GEN.12.4+GEN.12.5+GEN.12.6+GEN.12.7+GEN.12.8+GEN.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 12.1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.1+GEN.21.2+GEN.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.1–3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I took Abraham, your ancestor, from the land beyond the Euphrates and led him through the whole land of Canaan. I gave him many descendants. I gave him Isaac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.24+GEN.25.25+GEN.25.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 25.24–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.36.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.46.1+GEN.46.2+GEN.46.3+GEN.46.4+GEN.46.5+GEN.46.6+GEN.46.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "46.1–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 2.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to Isaac I gave Jacob and Esau. I gave Esau the hill country of Edom as his possession, but your ancestor Jacob and his children went down to Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ex 3.1—12.42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Later I sent Moses and Aaron, and I brought great trouble on Egypt. But I led you out; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.1+EXO.14.2+EXO.14.3+EXO.14.4+EXO.14.5+EXO.14.6+EXO.14.7+EXO.14.8+EXO.14.9+EXO.14.10+EXO.14.11+EXO.14.12+EXO.14.13+EXO.14.14+EXO.14.15+EXO.14.16+EXO.14.17+EXO.14.18+EXO.14.19+EXO.14.20+EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29+EXO.14.30+EXO.14.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 14.1–31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I brought your ancestors out of Egypt, and the Egyptians pursued them with chariots and cavalry. But when your ancestors got to the Red Sea ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they cried out to me for help, and I put darkness between them and the Egyptians. I made the sea come rolling over the Egyptians and drown them. You know what I did to Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘You lived in the desert a long time. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 21.21–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I brought you to the land of the Amorites, who lived on the east side of the Jordan. They fought you, but I gave you victory over them. You took their land, and I destroyed them as you advanced. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Num 22.1—24.25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the king of Moab, Balak son of Zippor, fought against you. He sent word to Balaam son of Beor and asked him to put a curse on you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I would not listen to Balaam, so he blessed you, and in this way I rescued you from Balak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.3.14+JOS.3.15+JOS.3.16+JOS.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 3.14–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.1+JOS.6.2+JOS.6.3+JOS.6.4+JOS.6.5+JOS.6.6+JOS.6.7+JOS.6.8+JOS.6.9+JOS.6.10+JOS.6.11+JOS.6.12+JOS.6.13+JOS.6.14+JOS.6.15+JOS.6.16+JOS.6.17+JOS.6.18+JOS.6.19+JOS.6.20+JOS.6.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6.1–21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You crossed the Jordan and came to Jericho. The men of Jericho fought against you, as did the Amorites, the Perizzites, the Canaanites, the Hittites, the Girgashites, the Hivites, and the Jebusites. But I gave you victory over them all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 23.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 7.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As you advanced, I threw them into panic in order to drive out the two Amorite kings. Your swords and bows had nothing to do with it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.10+DEU.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 6.10–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gave you a land that you had never cultivated and cities that you had not built. Now you are living there and eating grapes from vines that you did not plant, and olives from trees that you did not plant.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Now then,” Joshua continued, “honour the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and serve him sincerely and faithfully. Get rid of the gods which your ancestors used to worship in Mesopotamia and in Egypt, and serve only the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you are not willing to serve him, decide today whom you will serve, the gods your ancestors worshipped in Mesopotamia or the gods of the Amorites, in whose land you are now living. As for my family and me, we will serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people replied, “We would never leave the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to serve other gods! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God brought our fathers and us out of slavery in Egypt, and we saw the miracles that he performed. He kept us safe wherever we went among all the nations through which we passed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As we advanced into this land, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " drove out all the Amorites who lived here. So we also will serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; he is our God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
