            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and after his death they continued to do so as long as those leaders were alive who had seen for themselves everything that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
